SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Farmers Market,Community,Food,Crafts,New to the Area,Family Fun
DESCRIPTION:Corning Farmers Market\nFresh\, local\, and better than ever
 —the Corning Farmers Market is back and expanding for the season!\nJoin 
 us in downtown Corning each week to shop a wide variety of local produce\,
  baked goods\, handmade items\, and more from your favorite vendors. This 
 year\, we’re growing the market experience with additional vendors and f
 ood trucks around the Clock Tower\, bringing even more flavor\, variety\, 
 and energy to Market Street!\nThursdays\, June 4th through October 29th\n1
 0:00 AM – 2:00 PM\nDowntown Corning (Riverfront Centennial Park)\nMore w
 ays to shop:\nCustomers can use eWIC and SNAP benefits\, and we’re excit
 ed to offer Double Up Food Bucks (DUFBNY) again this year—helping you ge
 t even more fresh\, healthy food while supporting local vendors! (Some lim
 itations may apply)\nCome stroll\, shop\, and support local while enjoying
  the vibrant atmosphere of downtown Corning. There’s something for every
 one at the Farmers Market!\nImportant Update:\nWith the market expansion\,
  the Tioga Ave entrance side of the parking garage will be closed on Thurs
 days to accommodate vendors and ensure a safe\, enjoyable experience for a
 ll attendees. Please plan accordingly when visiting the market.\nA huge th
 ank you to our Summer in Downtown sponsor Williams Toyota!\n\nSource: Corn
 ing Area Chamber of Commerce - https://www.corningny.com/events/details/co
 rning-farmers-market-10-29-2026-19781
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.corningny.com/events/details/corning-farmers-market-10-29-
 2026-19781
END:VEVENT
