DESCRIPTION:Event by The Game Shoppe\n11 East Pulteney Street\nDuration: 3
  hr\nPublic\nFriday Night Magic — Draft\nJoin us for Magic: The Gatherin
 g Friday Night Magic Draft at The Game Shoppe.\nFriday Night Draft normall
 y features the newest Magic set. From time to time\, we’ll mix things up
  with special drafts\, throwback sets\, or alternate formats. Any change f
 rom the newest set will always be announced ahead of time.\nIf no special 
 announcement is made\, you can expect the current newest release.\nWhether
  you’re drafting casually\, improving your Limited skills\, or just look
 ing for a fun Friday night of Magic\, FNM Draft is a welcoming and relaxed
  way to play.\nFormat: Booster Draft\nSet: Newest set (unless otherwise an
 nounced)\nTime: 6:30 PM\nLocation: The Game Shoppe\nDraft smart. Play clea
 n. Have fun.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/ev
