 \nWear your best costume for a chance to win!\nPrizes will be awarded to t
 he Top 3 costumes of the night.\nIt’s also your LAST CHANCE to grab our 
 spooky October drink specials before they disappear until next year.\nKare
 n starts the afternoon behind the bar\nAmber joins in later to keep the dr
 inks flowing\nCalvin is in the kitchen until 10 PM\nEVENT T-SHIRTS\nLimite
 d Night of the Living Groove event shirts will be available to purchase at
  the door. $20 per tshirt.\nWant yours ahead of time? Message the MadCat M
 ediaWorks Facebook page to pre-order. You can grab it before the event or 
 have it waiting for you at the door.\nPLEASE HAVE YOUR ID READY WHEN ENTER
 ING\nWe will have someone checking IDs at the door.\nIf your costume inclu
 des a mask\, it MUST be removed for ID verification.\nNo ID = No Entry. No
  exceptions.\nGrab your costume\, round up your people and let’s make th
 is the Halloween party of the year.\nBrick • Corning\, NY\nSaturday\, Oc
 tober 31\nKira & The Kindness • 9 PM–12 AM\n#BrickCorning #NightOfTheL
 ivingGroove #KiraAndTheKindness #HalloweenAtBrick #HalloweenParty #Costume
 Contest #CorningNY #MadCatMediaWorks #LiveMusic #CorningNightlife\n\nSourc
