DESCRIPTION:Event by Friends of the Chemung River Watershed\, Inc.\n109 N.
  Main Street\, Elmira\, NY\nPublic\nHelp us restore garden beds and develo
 p pollinator-friendly gardens that are vital for a healthy natural environ
 ment. Throughout this project we will be planting many pollinator-friendly
  gardens throughout the Chemung River Watershed\, primarily at the establi
 shed beds at Mark Twain Riverfront Park\, and Bottcher's Landing Boat Laun
 ch. Check back here for status updates and for ways you can get involved!
